WEBVTT

00:00:34.380 --> 00:00:37.680
Before The Goodbye

00:00:43.690 --> 00:00:44.730
Kurau!

00:00:47.360 --> 00:00:49.320
C-Christmas...

00:00:49.860 --> 00:00:50.690
How's Windt?

00:00:53.110 --> 00:00:54.110
Kurau!

00:00:56.990 --> 00:00:58.160
Christmas!

00:00:58.160 --> 00:00:59.580
Windt is all right.

00:00:59.580 --> 00:01:01.290
You have to rest, Kurau.

00:01:01.290 --> 00:01:02.000
Watch out!

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:06.620
We have to send them back to their world quickly.

00:01:07.080 --> 00:01:08.790
The Rynax won't survive for long here.

00:01:08.790 --> 00:01:09.840
But Kurau!

00:01:09.840 --> 00:01:11.170
You're tired.

00:01:11.670 --> 00:01:13.050
You're tired...

00:01:13.340 --> 00:01:15.800
Please rest, Kurau!

00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:23.470
The Rynax came into this world
because they heard my voice.

00:01:24.020 --> 00:01:25.560
I have to do something about them.

00:01:25.890 --> 00:01:27.940
Kurau... But...

00:01:28.230 --> 00:01:29.810
Your body...

00:01:31.730 --> 00:01:33.780
Thanks, Christmas...

00:01:34.360 --> 00:01:39.280
I'm all right. Because I'll always be with you.

00:01:39.280 --> 00:01:40.160
That's why...

00:01:42.490 --> 00:01:44.200
Tell me when you're in danger, okay?

00:01:45.290 --> 00:01:45.960
Okay.

00:01:47.620 --> 00:01:54.590
Moonlight kawarazu ni ite
Moonlight, please never change

00:01:50.080 --> 00:01:52.800
Let's go, Christmas. You ready?

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:53.460
Yeah!

00:01:56.720 --> 00:02:03.810
Moonlight ai ni yuku Kimi ni
Moonlight, I'll come to see you

00:02:05.810 --> 00:02:12.820
Moonlight kakenobori kitto
Moonlight, I'll come running up and surely

00:02:15.030 --> 00:02:21.990
Moonlight mou ichido aeru
Moonlight, we'll be able to meet again

00:02:24.160 --> 00:02:36.300
Moonlight

00:02:42.470 --> 00:02:43.390
It's me.

00:02:44.430 --> 00:02:46.640
I see. Good job.

00:02:48.020 --> 00:02:50.600
No, I hear she's still unconscious.

00:02:51.850 --> 00:02:52.610
Yeah...

00:02:53.360 --> 00:02:54.230
Inspector...

00:02:55.020 --> 00:02:57.900
The doctor has OK'd the meeting with Windt Delyus.

00:02:58.360 --> 00:02:59.110
All right.

00:03:00.410 --> 00:03:03.370
What will happen to that girl now?

00:03:03.950 --> 00:03:07.410
That girl, Christmas, never existed in the first place.

00:03:07.410 --> 00:03:11.250
The Christmas who is there now
is Frank Zaksman's niece.

00:03:11.250 --> 00:03:14.250
From now on, she will go on living as a human.

00:03:15.340 --> 00:03:17.210
And as for Windt Delyus...

00:03:17.880 --> 00:03:20.760
He too will live as a human once again.

00:03:21.380 --> 00:03:23.800
He is no longer Rynax.

00:03:29.730 --> 00:03:31.600
What are you going to do for Christmas?

00:03:31.600 --> 00:03:35.110
Let's see now... I'm planning to go to
the festival at Shizuka Ocean.

00:03:35.110 --> 00:03:37.440
Really? With your new boyfriend?

00:03:58.710 --> 00:03:59.380
Kurau...

00:04:00.340 --> 00:04:02.430
Christmas was crying.

00:04:03.510 --> 00:04:04.930
You're no longer...

00:04:14.060 --> 00:04:15.190
Kurau!

00:04:15.940 --> 00:04:17.060
Thank goodness!

00:04:17.860 --> 00:04:19.190
Kurau...

00:04:34.290 --> 00:04:35.170
Kurau...

00:04:44.970 --> 00:04:46.180
You know, Dad...

00:04:46.180 --> 00:04:47.090
Yes?

00:04:47.550 --> 00:04:49.810
It's been a long time since we've been home.

00:04:50.810 --> 00:04:51.600
Yeah.

00:04:57.900 --> 00:05:00.190
It looks the same as when we left.

00:05:00.570 --> 00:05:02.740
I kept your room the same too.

00:05:02.740 --> 00:05:05.070
From today, we'll be living here together again.

00:05:05.950 --> 00:05:07.110
Miss...

00:05:08.030 --> 00:05:09.490
Miss Kurau...

00:05:13.540 --> 00:05:14.870
Miss!

00:05:15.370 --> 00:05:16.000
Ella...

00:05:16.710 --> 00:05:18.790
After the doctor called me,

00:05:18.790 --> 00:05:21.670
I dropped everything and rushed over.

00:05:21.670 --> 00:05:23.130
Thank you, Ella.

00:05:23.130 --> 00:05:25.170
My, how you've grown!

00:05:25.170 --> 00:05:27.470
I'd love to eat your cooking again, Ella.

00:05:27.470 --> 00:05:29.430
That's an easy request.

00:06:14.060 --> 00:06:17.180
What's the matter, Kurau? Are you up already?

00:06:17.180 --> 00:06:18.020
Yes...

00:06:18.690 --> 00:06:20.440
it's so nice this morning!

00:06:20.440 --> 00:06:21.610
Yes, it is.

00:06:22.520 --> 00:06:23.520
Dad...

00:06:24.070 --> 00:06:28.150
I remember the things that happened
when I was with the Rynax.

00:06:29.030 --> 00:06:29.780
Kurau...

00:06:30.450 --> 00:06:32.830
That person was happy.

00:06:32.830 --> 00:06:33.780
That person?

00:06:34.240 --> 00:06:36.540
Yes, she was happy.

00:06:37.370 --> 00:06:41.130
She was so happy that you were nice to her.

00:06:42.040 --> 00:06:43.790
And she was sad.

00:06:44.670 --> 00:06:48.340
When she left my body, she was sad.

00:06:49.970 --> 00:06:52.260
She couldn't say goodbye to you.

00:06:53.430 --> 00:06:56.970
She said she wanted to say goodbye...

00:07:04.940 --> 00:07:05.820
Kurau!

00:07:09.150 --> 00:07:10.860
KURAU!

00:07:29.880 --> 00:07:32.260
I'm sorry, Christmas.

00:07:32.840 --> 00:07:34.680
I'm going to have to leave you alone.

00:07:35.010 --> 00:07:36.060
I'm sorry.

00:07:47.480 --> 00:07:48.360
Kurau!

00:07:49.820 --> 00:07:55.200
She used the last ounce of her energy to save my body.

00:07:55.830 --> 00:07:57.790
She said she must return it to you, Dad.

00:07:58.450 --> 00:08:00.040
She said she promised you...

00:08:02.120 --> 00:08:04.580
She was starting to disappear...

00:08:04.580 --> 00:08:09.960
Even though she barely had any strength left, she protected my body.

00:08:10.880 --> 00:08:14.220
That person is no longer inside me.

00:08:15.010 --> 00:08:16.220
Not anywhere.

00:08:17.890 --> 00:08:18.890
Dad...

00:08:19.720 --> 00:08:23.230
I have to go where Christmas is.

00:08:23.230 --> 00:08:25.270
I must see her again.

00:08:25.900 --> 00:08:26.690
Kurau...

00:08:39.370 --> 00:08:41.290
You know, Eine...

00:08:41.830 --> 00:08:43.620
That girl remembered...

00:08:44.420 --> 00:08:46.130
About that day...

00:09:25.500 --> 00:09:28.380
Kurau had a big smile on her face as she slept.

00:09:28.380 --> 00:09:30.670
Yes, she did.

00:09:30.670 --> 00:09:34.300
She must have had so much fun.
She was in such great spirits.

00:09:34.300 --> 00:09:36.880
I know... I'm so glad.

00:09:37.760 --> 00:09:39.220
Eine...

00:09:39.640 --> 00:09:40.510
Thank you.

00:09:41.310 --> 00:09:44.560
I know you're in pain, yet you put on a happy face.

00:09:44.560 --> 00:09:48.650
Oh no, I wanted to do it.

00:09:49.270 --> 00:09:52.230
Thank you for letting me have my way.

00:09:52.780 --> 00:09:53.570
Eine...

00:09:54.570 --> 00:09:57.700
I wanted to create happy memories for her.

00:09:58.200 --> 00:10:01.280
I have nothing else to leave her.

00:10:02.120 --> 00:10:04.330
The least I could do was to give her today...

00:10:05.080 --> 00:10:06.250
She won't forget.

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:09.080
You can't forget either.

00:10:09.080 --> 00:10:11.420
Don't say you have nothing to leave her!

00:10:12.090 --> 00:10:15.630
You will always be with Kurau and me!

00:10:15.630 --> 00:10:19.930
Get better soon and we'll always be together from now on!

00:10:21.510 --> 00:10:22.140
Yes...

00:10:22.640 --> 00:10:24.640
Thank you, my love.

00:10:27.770 --> 00:10:29.350
You should call it a night.

00:10:29.350 --> 00:10:31.650
You have to get better soon!

00:10:31.650 --> 00:10:33.190
You have to beat this illness!

00:10:33.610 --> 00:10:34.650
That's right...

00:10:35.530 --> 00:10:36.650
I will!

00:11:21.820 --> 00:11:25.660
I know that I can't take the place of your Kurau.

00:11:26.040 --> 00:11:29.200
But you are very dear to me.

00:11:29.620 --> 00:11:31.040
I've watched you all along.

00:11:31.710 --> 00:11:33.040
Watched you...

00:11:35.090 --> 00:11:38.800
Watched you and your Kurau...

00:11:39.090 --> 00:11:40.260
All along...

00:11:40.930 --> 00:11:42.180
I remember.

00:11:42.890 --> 00:11:44.430
I could hear a voice.

00:11:44.890 --> 00:11:48.850
A gentle voice... that said, "I'm here."

00:11:54.520 --> 00:11:56.730
Don't worry, Kurau.

00:11:56.730 --> 00:11:59.190
Mom is always here...

00:12:05.450 --> 00:12:08.160
I was watching you.

00:12:08.160 --> 00:12:12.460
But Mom was watching over both of us...

00:12:12.920 --> 00:12:13.870
Always...

00:12:15.460 --> 00:12:16.290
Always...

00:12:18.960 --> 00:12:20.300
You want to work?

00:12:20.300 --> 00:12:22.840
Yes! I'll work any job.

00:12:22.840 --> 00:12:25.890
Kurau worked as an Agent.

00:12:25.890 --> 00:12:27.810
That's why I want to work too.

00:12:28.350 --> 00:12:29.310
And besides...

00:12:29.810 --> 00:12:32.850
Kurau's mom was always inside her.

00:12:36.020 --> 00:12:38.270
Kurau is inside me, too.

00:12:38.900 --> 00:12:42.070
My Pair, Kurau, is right here.

00:12:42.650 --> 00:12:46.530
That's why... That's why I want
to do something with Kurau.

00:12:46.870 --> 00:12:48.120
Christmas...

00:12:50.660 --> 00:13:00.130
Lonely Freedom

00:12:51.620 --> 00:12:55.580
Just as my sister's memories lived
inside Kurau's heart,

00:12:55.580 --> 00:12:59.420
Kurau lives inside your heart.

00:13:00.880 --> 00:13:03.260
Okay, Christmas.

00:13:00.880 --> 00:13:10.310
Lonely Freedom

00:13:03.260 --> 00:13:06.720
I'm pretty sure that the restaurant in
town was looking for help.

00:13:06.720 --> 00:13:08.550
Let's go ask them later.

00:13:09.430 --> 00:13:10.310
Okay!

00:13:11.100 --> 00:13:20.690
Lonely Freedom

00:13:18.270 --> 00:13:19.570
Good morning!

00:13:19.570 --> 00:13:21.400
Good morning, Christmas!

00:13:21.400 --> 00:13:30.870
Lonely Freedom

00:13:28.070 --> 00:13:29.490
Hey, refill, please!

00:13:29.490 --> 00:13:31.450
Okay, I'll be right there!

00:13:31.450 --> 00:13:41.340
Lonely Freedom

00:13:41.920 --> 00:13:51.430
Lonely Freedom

00:13:52.510 --> 00:13:56.020
10 Years Later

00:13:58.150 --> 00:13:59.270
Come in.

00:14:02.020 --> 00:14:04.610
It's been a while, Inspector Ayaka.

00:14:04.610 --> 00:14:08.320
You're about the only one who calls me
Ayaka at work, Chief Commissioner.

00:14:08.320 --> 00:14:09.110
Is that right?

00:14:09.820 --> 00:14:10.490
Yes...

00:14:11.490 --> 00:14:13.290
How was Switzerland?

00:14:13.290 --> 00:14:15.290
Was Christmas doing okay?

00:14:15.290 --> 00:14:19.120
Yes, she's a cook at a restaurant.

00:14:19.120 --> 00:14:21.840
Her food was delicious.

00:14:22.500 --> 00:14:23.460
I see...

00:14:25.920 --> 00:14:28.840
I heard that they are going to stop
the use of Rynax energy.

00:14:29.380 --> 00:14:33.890
The efficiency of Rynax energy has been
dropping over these ten years.

00:14:34.680 --> 00:14:38.560
Its value as a next-generation
energy source is practically nil.

00:14:38.980 --> 00:14:40.270
The Rynax...

00:14:40.900 --> 00:14:42.060
Why do you think that is?

00:14:43.070 --> 00:14:47.110
Perhaps Kurau took them somewhere far away.

00:14:47.490 --> 00:14:48.610
Kurau did?

00:14:50.240 --> 00:14:51.320
Maybe...

00:14:51.950 --> 00:14:56.330
Kurau took everything upon herself and saved us.

00:14:56.910 --> 00:14:58.290
All by herself...

00:14:59.540 --> 00:15:02.000
I hope something like that never happens again.

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:04.710
The Rynax will probably never
pour out into this world.

00:15:05.300 --> 00:15:09.590
But even without the Rynax,
the GPO is gaining power.

00:15:10.090 --> 00:15:15.640
Power hungry men like Saito still exist.

00:15:16.220 --> 00:15:17.140
Saito...

00:15:17.720 --> 00:15:20.690
But we can stop that from happening.

00:15:20.690 --> 00:15:22.310
That's why I'm here.

00:15:22.900 --> 00:15:24.020
Yes...

00:15:24.020 --> 00:15:27.110
Although I'm just echoing your father's beliefs.

00:15:27.690 --> 00:15:28.780
Ayaka...

00:15:29.490 --> 00:15:33.700
What do you see now in that
dark hole in your heart?

00:15:34.320 --> 00:15:35.660
Now that you're...

00:15:36.660 --> 00:15:40.620
When Saito died, my darkness disappeared.

00:15:41.210 --> 00:15:43.750
Just a hollow opening remained.

00:15:44.460 --> 00:15:46.340
Only an empty hole...

00:15:47.590 --> 00:15:49.340
But I'm all right now.

00:15:49.880 --> 00:15:53.340
By the way, I went to Switzerland
with my family, you know.

00:15:54.640 --> 00:15:56.310
Really...

00:15:56.310 --> 00:15:57.760
Mom!

00:15:57.760 --> 00:16:00.560
Naoki, where's Big Sister and Dad?

00:16:00.560 --> 00:16:02.770
They're over there buying juice.

00:16:02.770 --> 00:16:05.900
Oh my, look at how muddy you got!

00:16:05.900 --> 00:16:07.650
We're going to the grave, you know!

00:16:08.030 --> 00:16:09.230
You little rascal.

00:16:10.650 --> 00:16:11.820
Too bad!

00:16:12.150 --> 00:16:13.160
That boy...

00:16:13.530 --> 00:16:14.660
Hey, Dad!

00:16:14.660 --> 00:16:16.490
I want juice too!

00:16:16.490 --> 00:16:18.660
Come on, Naoki. That's mine!

00:16:18.660 --> 00:16:20.250
Aw, come on, don't be stingy!

00:16:20.250 --> 00:16:22.750
Hey guys, don't fight!

00:16:22.750 --> 00:16:25.630
Okay you guys, share!

00:16:25.630 --> 00:16:26.670
Okay!

00:16:32.510 --> 00:16:34.260
Huh? Christmas?

00:16:34.260 --> 00:16:36.760
I thought the restaurant was closed on Mondays.

00:16:36.760 --> 00:16:40.350
Today's special. I have an
important guest coming today.

00:16:40.350 --> 00:16:41.180
Important?

00:16:41.180 --> 00:16:43.520
Yup. My boyfriend!

00:16:45.900 --> 00:16:47.400
Thanks for waiting.

00:16:47.400 --> 00:16:49.020
Wow, this looks great.

00:16:49.690 --> 00:16:51.030
Thanks for the food!

00:17:01.410 --> 00:17:02.910
Is it good, Ted?

00:17:02.910 --> 00:17:06.000
I-It's delicious, Christmas!

00:17:06.000 --> 00:17:07.380
Thank you!

00:17:09.290 --> 00:17:12.460
Sorry to come on your day off.

00:17:12.460 --> 00:17:13.920
No problem.

00:17:13.920 --> 00:17:16.760
I'm usually so busy,
I wouldn't have time to relax.

00:17:16.760 --> 00:17:20.060
Is that right... You sure are
working hard, Christmas.

00:17:20.560 --> 00:17:22.140
I'm just happy.

00:17:22.140 --> 00:17:25.690
Seeing everyone eat the food I make.

00:17:26.310 --> 00:17:27.730
Brings me pleasure.

00:17:28.020 --> 00:17:29.940
That's why I cook.

00:17:30.360 --> 00:17:31.690
For everyone...

00:17:36.700 --> 00:17:39.030
Are you still daydreaming?

00:17:39.030 --> 00:17:40.450
I'm not...

00:17:42.410 --> 00:17:45.960
That girl... She seemed so lonely after all.

00:17:46.670 --> 00:17:48.210
No matter how much she was smiling.

00:17:50.790 --> 00:17:53.420
I wonder what I can do to help her?

00:17:54.720 --> 00:17:59.800
There's only one person who can
give Christmas back her smile.

00:18:00.680 --> 00:18:02.260
But that person is...

00:18:47.730 --> 00:18:50.810
This world... is so wide...

00:19:03.370 --> 00:19:05.120
Don't cry, Christmas.

00:19:05.830 --> 00:19:09.210
I'll always be watching over you.

00:19:10.120 --> 00:19:14.840
You, too, have been watching over me
like this, haven't you?

00:19:15.750 --> 00:19:18.420
Even when I thought I was all alone...

00:19:19.630 --> 00:19:20.930
Wait for me.

00:19:20.930 --> 00:19:23.100
I'll with you soon.

00:19:23.100 --> 00:19:25.140
By your side...

00:19:27.270 --> 00:19:28.140
Kurau...

00:19:31.020 --> 00:19:33.520
Kurau... I'm so lonely...

00:19:34.520 --> 00:19:37.360
I miss you... I'm lonely!

00:20:25.370 --> 00:20:27.160
Look, Christmas.

00:20:27.160 --> 00:20:30.000
The Rynax have found a wide world.

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:32.210
Somewhere that's not here...

00:20:32.210 --> 00:20:34.880
A wide world where the Rynax can go out into.

00:20:35.630 --> 00:20:38.380
I want to see that world too.

00:20:38.380 --> 00:20:41.170
A new, bigger world.

00:20:42.090 --> 00:20:43.930
But, Christmas.

00:20:43.930 --> 00:20:45.840
I'll stay right by your side.

00:20:46.470 --> 00:20:48.050
I'll be with you!

00:20:57.940 --> 00:20:59.520
Welcome home, Kurau.

00:20:59.900 --> 00:21:01.780
I'm home! Christmas!

00:21:09.830 --> 00:21:11.200
Christmas...

00:21:11.660 --> 00:21:14.250
So, she's come home.

00:21:14.250 --> 00:21:15.790
Your Kurau...

00:21:16.580 --> 00:21:17.710
I'm so happy for you.

00:21:18.250 --> 00:21:20.000
You won't be lonely any more.

00:21:22.260 --> 00:21:26.930
Dad... I was probably lonely, too...

00:21:27.510 --> 00:21:29.640
Ever since Mom died...

00:21:30.350 --> 00:21:32.680
I was probably looking for something.

00:21:33.430 --> 00:21:37.690
Maybe that's why the Rynax entered my body.

00:21:38.480 --> 00:21:42.570
Maybe I was the one seeking them out.

00:21:43.440 --> 00:21:46.780
But, everything's all right now...

00:21:47.360 --> 00:21:49.660
Grandpa! Mom's home.

00:21:50.450 --> 00:21:52.410
I'm home, Dad!

00:21:52.870 --> 00:21:54.910
Welcome home, Kurau.

00:21:54.910 --> 00:21:58.710
Keep on holding me

00:21:54.910 --> 00:22:03.590
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:21:58.710 --> 00:22:03.590
I listen to your voice in your arms

00:22:05.260 --> 00:22:16.170
If I reach out in the light, I can touch

00:22:05.260 --> 00:22:16.170
Hikari no naka ni te wo sashinobaseba todoku

00:22:16.900 --> 00:22:21.470
The precious arms

00:22:16.900 --> 00:22:26.910
Anna ni motomete ita kakegae no nai ude e

00:22:21.470 --> 00:22:26.910
I have been searching for so hard

00:22:27.680 --> 00:22:33.780
I turn around and the sky of blue

00:22:27.680 --> 00:22:33.780
Furimukeba kodoku ni wa

00:22:34.650 --> 00:22:43.280
Smiles down upon my solitude

00:22:34.650 --> 00:22:43.280
Sora ga aoku hohoende kureru

00:22:43.630 --> 00:22:50.580
In the darkness, I nearly lose sight of my dreams

00:22:43.630 --> 00:22:50.580
Kurayami ni yume wo miushinai sou ni naru

00:22:51.070 --> 00:22:58.420
But if you remain by my side

00:22:51.070 --> 00:22:58.420
Demo anata ga itekureru no nara

00:22:59.010 --> 00:23:02.740
Keep on holding me

00:22:59.010 --> 00:23:06.400
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:23:02.740 --> 00:23:06.410
I listen to your voice in your arms

